              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukhuphula umlotha; inhliziyo ekhohlisayo imjikisile, ukuze angakwazi ukusindisa umphefumulo wakhe futhi angasho ukuthi: Akukho manga esandleni sami sokunene na?",
