        {
          "text": "Hlabelelani nina mazulu! ngokuba uJehova ukwenzile; thokozani nina zingxenye eziphansi zomhlaba. Jabulani nina zintaba, hlathi, nemithi yonke ekulo, ngokuba uJehova umhlengile uJakobe, wamkhazimulisa kwa-Israyeli.",
